// --- combat, the other way ---

// The same kit and the same pool, grown toward standing there rather than toward
// killing what is in front of you. It is a different character and not a worse one:
// every worn piece takes a stout-heart for the mending at its sixth position, which
// is +2 regeneration a piece, so the pool refills faster than a room empties it.
// Health experience is paid on damage taken, so this is the build that trains it --
// the attack tiers above cannot, and reading health off them says more about what
// they were grown for than about any room.

